    {
        "title": "Flood",
        "artist": "They Might Be Giants",
        "discovered": 2017,
        "image": "Flood_TheyMightBeGiants.jpg",
        "genre": "geek rock",
        "comment": "i was introduced to TMBG by my high school science teacher. he played both their 'the sun is a mass of incandescent gas' as well as their sheepishly corrective 'the sun is a miasma of incandescent plasma' one day in class, for our astronomy module or something. i got the vibe the rest of the class thought it was kinda lame but i thought it slapped. the next week, i found Flood in the public library and gave it a listen.<br><br>you were great mr dixon. i remember doodling a goofy caricature of you in class, my friends and i were snickering at it. you came over to check out the fuss. i was so embarrassed. how offensive! but you said it was great, you asked if you could 'confiscate' it and put it up in your office.<br><br>it was still there when i came to say my goodbyes to you on the last day of year 13. you were a fantastic teacher. i hope you're having a wonderful life, wherever you are"
    },
